                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>NSC 177 was first discussed by the National Security Council at the meeting held
                    January 8, 1954. The conversation on that occasion was devoted entirely to
                    Indochinese questions. For the pertinent section of the memorandum of
                    discussion, see <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v13p1/pg_947">volume XIII, Part 1,
                        page 947</ref>.</p>
            </div>
